  "details": "Right now we can chose between shown, icon only or hidden:\n\n-Shown is too much, it's like a whole billboard of mostly useless visual clutter, it almost completely covers the top half of the visual field in crowded instances.\n\n-Icon only is mostly useless because most people either don't set one or change it all the time so it's not a reliable identifier.\n\n-Hidden is confusing because some people change avis all the time.\n\nI want the option to just display the username, and nothing else.\n\nThis is as much needed as an accessibility feature for some as it is simply a practical way to keep our visual field clean and readable in VR or everyone.\n\nI know this request has been denied already 6 years ago but without providing clear justification, only mentioning an \"ealrier post\" now lost to time. The landscape is changing and it feels like it needs to be adressed again as the UI and nameplates are being reworked again.",
